  [; ── platform: store RETIRED (RULED: RS-12, RS-8; #1591 item K3) ───────
     Every rule of this block left with cx-platform-store's leave step: vcx/cxstore/,
     vcx/store/ (module store; the store, journal, live, audit and ft dispatchers with
